  "description": "Automatically converts DateTime values to UTC when writing to PostgreSQL and ensures\n      all DateTime values read back are marked as DateTimeKind.Utc.\n      Supports raw Npgsql, Dapper, and EF Core.",
  "id": "ChronoSafe.Npgsql",
