  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1\n\t\t  - Fixed: PostgreSQL connection error \"invalid command-line argument for server process: TimeZone=UTC\".\n\t\t  The options startup parameter now correctly uses the -c TimeZone=UTC format required by PostgreSQL.\n\t\t  This fix resolves compatibility issues with Neon, Supabase, and direct PostgreSQL connections.",
